counts that allow you to invest up to &pound;20,000 per year (in the 2023&ndash;24 tax year) without paying any tax on the interest or capital gains that you earn. ISA holders do not pay taxes on interest, income, or capital gains from cash and investments held in an ISA.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&amp;gt;&lt;/div&gt;"  href="https://rebeldonegans.com/glossary/isas/"  data-gt-translate-attributes='[{"attribute":"data-cmtooltip", "format":"html"}]'  tabindex='0' role='link'>ISAs</a>, general investment accounts, defined contribution pensions, workplace investment pensions, <a class="glossaryLink"  aria-describedby="tt"  data-cmtooltip="&lt;div class=glossaryItemBody&gt;&amp;lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&amp;gt;Self Invested Personal Pension&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&amp;gt;&amp;lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&amp;gt;A self-invested personal pension (SIPP) is a tax-efficient retirement savings account available in the U.K.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&amp;gt;&lt;/div&gt;"  href="https://rebeldonegans.com/glossary/sipps/"  data-gt-translate-attributes='[{"attribute":"data-cmtooltip", "format":"html"}]'  tabindex='0' role='link'>SIPPs</a> and equivalent international investment accounts. Do not include State Pension, capitalised DB or final-salary pension values, rental-property value, future income, your home, emergency funds or cash reserved for planned spending. Enter future income separately to prevent double counting.</span></label><div class="rfs-fc-inputrow"><input id="fund" type="number" min="0" max="3000000" step="1000" value="100000"><input id="fund-range" type="range" min="0" max="3000000" step="1000" value="100000"><output class="rfs-fc-pill" id="fund-pill" for="fund fund-range">100,000</output></div></div><div class="rfs-fc-field"><label class="rfs-fc-label" for="contribution">Monthly amount added<button class="rfs-fc-info" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information about Monthly amount added">i</button><span class="rfs-fc-tip">Include personal contributions, employer contributions and applicable pension tax relief. Exclude DB scheme contributions.</span></label><div class="rfs-fc-inputrow"><input id="contribution" type="number" min="0" max="20000" step="100" value="1000"><input id="contribution-range" type="range" min="0" max="20000" step="100" value="1000"><output class="rfs-fc-pill" id="contribution-pill" for="contribution contribution-range">1,000</output></div></div></div></details> <details class="rfs-fc-accordion" open><summary>The life you want <span class="rfs-fc-sum" id="life-summary"></span><span class="rfs-fc-summary-symbol" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="rfs-fc-fields"><div class="rfs-fc-field"><label class="rfs-fc-label" for="freedom-age">Your Desired Freedom Age<button class="rfs-fc-info" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information about Your Freedom Age">i</button><span class="rfs-fc-tip">The age you would love to have more freedom, even if full Financial Freedom comes later.</span></label><div class="rfs-fc-inputrow"><input id="freedom-age" type="number" min="18" max="100" step="1" value="60"><input id="freedom-age-range" type="range" min="18" max="100" step="1" value="60"><output class="rfs-fc-pill" id="freedom-age-pill" for="freedom-age freedom-age-range">60</output></div></div><div class="rfs-fc-field"><label class="rfs-fc-label" for="withdrawal">Your withdrawal-rate assumption<button class="rfs-fc-info" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information about Your withdrawal-rate assumption">i</button><span class="rfs-fc-tip">Choose any rate from 1.0% to 10.0%. The results also compare 4% and 5%.</span></label><div class="rfs-fc-inputrow"><input id="withdrawal" type="number" min="1" max="10" step="0.1" value="4"><input id="withdrawal-range" type="range" min="1" max="10" step="0.1" value="4"><output class="rfs-fc-pill" id="withdrawal-pill" for="withdrawal withdrawal-range">4.0%</output></div><div class="rfs-fc-chips"><button class="rfs-fc-chip rfs-fc-is-active" type="button" data-rate="4">4% planning</button><button class="rfs-fc-chip" type="button" data-rate="5">5% flexible</button></div></div><div class="rfs-fc-field"><label class="rfs-fc-label" for="essential">Essential annual spending<button class="rfs-fc-info" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information about Essential annual spending">i</button><span class="rfs-fc-tip">Housing, food, utilities, transport, insurance, healthcare and other spending you consider essential.</span></label><div class="rfs-fc-inputrow"><input id="essential" type="number" min="0" max="150000" step="500" value="25000"><input id="essential-range" type="range" min="0" max="150000" step="500" value="25000"><output class="rfs-fc-pill" id="essential-pill" for="essential essential-range">25,000</output></div></div><div class="rfs-fc-field"><label class="rfs-fc-label" for="discretionary">Choices and fun annual spending<button class="rfs-fc-info" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information about Choices and fun annual spending">i</button><span class="rfs-fc-tip">Travel, restaurants, hobbies, gifts, upgrades, adventures and spending you could change.</span></label><div class="rfs-fc-inputrow"><input id="discretionary" type="number" min="0" max="150000" step="500" value="15000"><input id="discretionary-range" type="range" min="0" max="150000" step="500" value="15000"><output class="rfs-fc-pill" id="discretionary-pill" for="discretionary discretionary-range">15,000</output></div></div><div class="rfs-fc-total"><span>Total desired annual spending</span><span id="total-spending">40,000</span></div></div></details> <details class="rfs-fc-accordion"><summary>Later income <span class="rfs-fc-sum" id="income-summary"></span><span class="rfs-fc-summary-symbol" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="rfs-fc-fields"><div class="rfs-fc-field"><span class="rfs-fc-label">State or government pension<button class="rfs-fc-info" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information">i</button><span class="rfs-fc-tip">Annual income and the age it begins. Do not include a capital value in your Freedom Fund.</span></span><div class="rfs-fc-income rfs-fc-two"><div><label class="rfs-fc-mini">Annual income</label><input id="state-amount" type="number" value="12000"></div><div><label class="rfs-fc-mini">Start age</label><input id="state-start" type="number" value="68"></div></div></div><div class="rfs-fc-field"><span class="rfs-fc-label">Defined benefit or final-salary pension<button class="rfs-fc-info" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information">i</button><span class="rfs-fc-tip">Enter the promised annual income, not a capitalised value.</span></span><div class="rfs-fc-income rfs-fc-two"><div><label class="rfs-fc-mini">Annual income</label><input id="db-amount" type="number" value="0"></div><div><label class="rfs-fc-mini">Start age</label><input id="db-start" type="number" value="65"></div></div></div><div class="rfs-fc-field"><span class="rfs-fc-label">Rental profit or other ongoing income<button class="rfs-fc-info" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information">i</button><span class="rfs-fc-tip">Enter annual profit after costs. Add an end age only if this income will stop.</span></span><div class="rfs-fc-income"><div><label class="rfs-fc-mini">Annual income</label><input id="other-amount" type="number" value="0"></div><div><label class="rfs-fc-mini">Start age</label><input id="other-start" type="number" value="40"></div><div><label class="rfs-fc-mini">End age</label><input id="other-end" type="number" placeholder="No end"></div></div></div><div class="rfs-fc-field"><span class="rfs-fc-label">Part-time or side-hustle income<button class="rfs-fc-info" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information">i</button><span class="rfs-fc-tip">Counted only between the start and end ages entered.</span></span><div class="rfs-fc-income"><div><label class="rfs-fc-mini">Annual income</label><input id="part-amount" type="number" value="0"></div><div><label class="rfs-fc-mini">Start age</label><input id="part-start" type="number" value="60"></div><div><label class="rfs-fc-mini">End age</label><input id="part-end" type="number" value="68"></div></div></div></div></details> <details class="rfs-fc-accordion"><summary>Adjust assumptions <span class="rfs-fc-sum" id="assumptions-summary"></span><span class="rfs-fc-summary-symbol" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="rfs-fc-fields"><div class="rfs-fc-field"><span class="rfs-fc-label">Investment growth before inflation<button class="rfs-fc-info" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information">i</button><span class="rfs-fc-tip">A straight-line planning assumption. Actual returns will vary significantly.</span></span><input id="growth" type="number" value="10" step="0.1"></div><div class="rfs-fc-field"><span class="rfs-fc-label">Inflation<button class="rfs-fc-info" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information">i</button><span class="rfs-fc-tip">All outputs are shown in today&rsquo;s money.</span></span><input id="inflation" type="number" value="2.5" step="0.1"></div><div class="rfs-fc-field"><span class="rfs-fc-label">Annual fees<button class="rfs-fc-info" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information">i</button><span class="rfs-fc-tip">Enter fees not already reflected in the growth figure. Avoid deducting the same charge twice.</span></span><input id="fees" type="number" value="0.2" step="0.1"></div><div class="rfs-fc-field"><span class="rfs-fc-label">Calculated real investment growth</span><div class="rfs-fc-total"><span>After inflation and fees</span><span id="real-growth">7.1%</span></div></div></div></details><div class="rfs-fc-actions"><button class="rfs-fc-btn rfs-fc-secondary" id="reset" type="button">Reset example</button><button class="rfs-fc-btn rfs-fc-primary" id="jump" type="button">See my freedom</button></div><div class="rfs-fc-error" id="error"></div></section><section class="rfs-fc-results" id="results"><div class="rfs-fc-hero"><p class="rfs-fc-kicker">Look how much freedom you have already built</p><h2 class="rfs-fc-herovalue" id="hero-income">0 a year</h2><p class="rfs-fc-herocopy" id="hero-copy"></p></div><div class="rfs-fc-card"><h3 id="freedom-age-title">What could freedom look like?</h3><div class="rfs-fc-copy" id="freedom-age-copy"></div><div class="rfs-fc-spendlabels"><div class="rfs-fc-ess" id="essential-label">Essentials</div><div class="rfs-fc-choices" id="choices-label">Choices &amp; fun</div></div><div class="rfs-fc-coverage"><div class="rfs-fc-cover-fund" id="cover-fund"></div><div class="rfs-fc-cover-income" id="cover-income"></div><div class="rfs-fc-essential-mark" id="essential-mark"></div></div><div class="rfs-fc-coverage-values"><span><span class="rfs-fc-key-square rfs-fc-key-fund"></span>Freedom Fund: <strong id="cover-fund-value"></strong></span><span><span class="rfs-fc-key-square rfs-fc-key-income"></span>Other income: <strong id="cover-income-value"></strong></span><span><span class="rfs-fc-key-square rfs-fc-key-gap"></span>Remaining gap: <strong id="cover-gap-value"></strong></span></div><p class="rfs-fc-phase" id="phase-copy"></p></div><div class="rfs-fc-card"><h3>Your Freedom Path</h3><div class="rfs-fc-path"><div class="rfs-fc-step"><div class="rfs-fc-milestone-circle">25%</div><span class="rfs-fc-step-description">Of spending covered</span><strong class="rfs-fc-step-age" id="m25">--</strong></div><div class="rfs-fc-path-line" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="rfs-fc-step rfs-fc-step-blue"><div class="rfs-fc-milestone-circle">50%</div><span class="rfs-fc-step-description">Of spending covered</span><strong class="rfs-fc-step-age" id="m50">--</strong></div><div class="rfs-fc-path-line" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="rfs-fc-step rfs-fc-step-purple"><div class="rfs-fc-milestone-circle">75%</div><span class="rfs-fc-step-description">Of spending covered</span><strong class="rfs-fc-step-age" id="m75">--</strong></div><div class="rfs-fc-path-line" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="rfs-fc-step rfs-fc-step-yellow"><div class="rfs-fc-milestone-circle">100%<br>FREE</div><span class="rfs-fc-step-description">Full Financial Freedom</span><strong class="rfs-fc-step-age" id="m100">--</strong></div></div><div class="rfs-fc-target"><h3>Your Full Financial Freedom Fund</h3><div class="rfs-fc-target-head"><span><strong id="target-current">0</strong> built</span><span><strong id="target-total">0</strong> target</span></div><div class="rfs-fc-target-track" role="img" aria-label="Current Freedom Fund compared with the Full Financial Freedom Fund target"><div class="rfs-fc-target-built" id="target-built"></div></div><p class="rfs-fc-target-gap"><span id="target-gap">0</span> still to build</p><p class="rfs-fc-copy">This is the Freedom Fund the model estimates you would need today to support the full lifestyle entered, allowing for income that begins later. Later pensions and other permanent income can reduce the amount required today.</p></div></div><details class="rfs-fc-result-detail"><summary>Compare withdrawal-rate assumptions<span class="rfs-fc-summary-symbol" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="rfs-fc-copy">A higher rate produces a lower target, but leaves less margin and requires more flexibility.</p><div class="rfs-fc-table-wrap"><table class="rfs-fc-comparison-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Withdrawal-rate assumption</th><th scope="col">Full Financial Freedom Fund target</th><th scope="col">Full Financial Freedom age</th></tr></thead><tbody id="comparisons"></tbody></table></div></details> <details class="rfs-fc-result-detail"><summary>See how your Freedom Fund grows<span class="rfs-fc-summary-symbol" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="rfs-fc-key"><span><i class="rfs-fc-dot" style="background:#76AF8C"></i>Projected Freedom Fund</span><span><i class="rfs-fc-dot" style="background:#D24D6C"></i>Freedom Fund you need</span></div><div class="rfs-fc-chart" id="chart"></div></details> <details class="rfs-fc-result-detail"><summary>What changes could you make?<span class="rfs-fc-summary-symbol" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p class="rfs-fc-copy">These examples show how each change could affect your projected full Financial Freedom age.</p><div class="rfs-fc-moves" id="moves"></div></details> <details class="rfs-fc-result-detail"><summary>Want to go deeper?<span class="rfs-fc-summary-symbol" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="rfs-fc-next"><a href="https://rebeldonegans.com/bridging-calculator/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Build your detailed bridge &rarr;</strong><span>Check whether enough money sits in accessible accounts before pensions unlock.</span></a><a href="https://rebeldonegans.com/finance/fire/forecasting/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Forecast your financial future &rarr;</strong><span>Model changing work, accounts, lump sums and detailed scenarios.</span></a></div></details><div class="rfs-fc-note" id="note"></div></section></div></div> <!-- END: RFS FREEDOM CALCULATOR HTML CSS --><section class="rfs-freedom-feedback"><p> Found a bug? Got an idea? Think we've missed something?</p><p> <a href="https://rebeldonegans.com/tools/feedback" target="_blank" rel="noopener"> &#128161; Send tool &amp; tech feedback </a></p></section> <style> .rfs-freedom-feedback{
